
! ===================================================================
! IEEE 123-bus — V2G Storage additions (auto-generated)
! Each listed load bus gets 10 V2G chargers modeled as Storage (ESS).
! Assumptions (edit as needed):
!   - kWRated = 7 kW per charger
!   - kWhRated = 70 kWh per charger
!   - %reserve = 10 (kept in the battery, not dispatched)
!   - Efficiencies: %EffCharge=95, %EffDischarge=95
!   - Control: StorageController Mode=FOLLOW tracking kWTargetShape=V2G_<LoadName>
!              Positive kW in the CSV => discharge to the grid (V2G)
!              Negative kW in the CSV => charging from the grid
!   - The CSV files should be placed alongside the DSS files and named exactly V2G_<LoadName>.csv
!   - Phases/Conn/Bus1/kV match the parent Load.* element
! Usage:
!   - After compiling the base IEEE123 DSS, `Redirect` this file OR `Compile` it after the base circuit.
! ===================================================================


